      238.97,
      401.91,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(1)in paragraph (b), by the substitution for the words\u201cchargeable for one complete year prior to thecommencement of the liquidation, that year to beselected\u201d of the words \u201cchargeable for fivecomplete years prior to the commencement of theliquidation, that five year period to be selected\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      322.97,
      401.87,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "(2)in paragraph (d), by the repeal of that paragraphand substitution therefor of the following newparagraph :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      203.13,
      370.97,
      401.9,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(d)value added tax charged or chargeable fortaxable periods within five year period priorto the commencement of the liquidation,such taxable periods to be selected by theCommissioner-General of Inland Revenuein accordance with the provisions of theValue Added Tax Act, No. 14 of 2002;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      466.97,
      401.91,
      502.31
    ],
